{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお仕事のあとに\nななみ、いくちゃん、みなみ\nとご飯食べました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肉を食べた。\nどうもタン塩担当\nまりっかでございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焼く担当でもあります。\nこだわりがあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焼くなら任せろ！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"い\"っ！って顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人式の振袖のななみがね～\nもうね～まりっか好み"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒髪おかっぱに黄色とか\n最高やーん！\nって言ったら照れてた～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"韓国のパンツは、ＰＶで\n行った時に買ったやつ？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだよ^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はまってるものは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無糖のヨーグルトに\nはちみつかけて食べること"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別に着る服装:迷ってます、\nどんなの着てきて欲しい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきな服着て来てよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近まいまいとじゃれましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイムリーや！\n昨日めっちゃじゃれた！！うへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会の時\n何をやれば認知してもらえる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなに認知力に自信ないから...\nいっぱい来てくれたら\n自然と覚えるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪引いてないですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫です！\n元気もりもりっ\n風邪引かないように気をつけるね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マーチン何足ぐらい\nもってるー(　ﾟдﾟ)？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェリーレッドのローカット\nブラックのヒールブーツ\nママのおさがりの限定？ブーツ\nの3足。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねころは足が21.5センチｗｗｗ\nらしいのですが、まりっかの足は\n何センチメンタル←なのでしょう？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"23.5です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"積もった次の日に凍る雪って\nなんだかセンチメンタルなのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会の服装って\nどんな風に決めてるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気分だったりリクエストだったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/16/6217039/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日載せ忘れたメガネ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でかけたりはずしたり\n忙しかった笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}